  "body": "In `/-?(([0-9]+\\.[0-9]*|[0-9]*\\.[0-9]+)([Ee][+-]?[0-9]+)?|[0-9]+[Ee][+-]?[0-9]+)/`  — _er, wait, I think this will be a little easier to see if we translate to an idiomatic ES pattern first._ In\r\n\r\n```js\r\n/-?((\\d+\\.\\d*|\\d*\\.\\d+)(E[+-]?\\d+)?|\\d+E[+-]?\\d+)/i\r\n```\r\n\r\nthe second `\\d*` can only ever match the empty string (`\\d{0,0}`) because `\\d+\\.\\d*` (`\\d{1,∞}\\.\\d{0,∞}`) is inclusive of `\\d+\\.\\d+` (`\\d{1,∞}\\.\\d{1,∞}`). As it “does nothing”, it seems clearer to not include it:\r\n\r\n```js\r\n/-?((\\d+\\.\\d*|\\.\\d+)(E[+-]?\\d+)?|\\d+E[+-]?\\d+)/i\r\n```",
